    <briefdescription>
<para>Descriptor of a data object attached to a process instance. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stored in RocksDB under the key prefix <computeroutput>proc:attach:</computeroutput> &lt;instance_id&gt;:&lt;object_id&gt;.</para>
<para>The <computeroutput>metadata</computeroutput> field carries link-specific properties, e.g.: <programlisting filename=".json"><codeline><highlight class="normal">{<sp/>&quot;required&quot;:<sp/>true,<sp/>&quot;doc_type&quot;:<sp/>&quot;Bauzeichnung&quot;,<sp/>&quot;pages&quot;:<sp/>4<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
